        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "More complete, fun and realistic than ever, the Hunting Challenge series has earned a reputation as the best hunting simulation for consoles.\n\nRealistic animal behaviour, a variety of environments, weapons, animals, hunting plans, equipment and skills to unlock, online leaderboards, training in shooting at fixed and moving targets… all are brought together to offer a unique gaming experience which will delight experienced and novice hunters as well as players just looking to experience something new.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Más completo, divertido y realista que nunca, la serie Hunting Challenge se ha ganado la reputación de ser la mejor simulación de caza para consolas.\n\nComportamiento realista de los animales, variedad de entornos, armas, animales, planes de caza, equipamiento y habilidades por desbloquear, clasificaciones en línea, entrenamiento de tiro a objetivos fijos y móviles… todo reunido para ofrecer una experiencia única que deleitará tanto a cazadores experimentados y principiantes como a quienes simplemente buscan probar algo nuevo.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2013",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
